{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13110180","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13110180","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1311018001:1":{"text":"이 무덤 아래로 내려간 다음, 주 통로를 따라 앞으로 가면 대성당 내부로 갈 수 있을 거예요.","source_cn":"从这座墓穴下去，沿着主墓道一直向前，就可以通往大教堂内部。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1745FCC9ACFEB2CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1311018002:1":{"text":"이 묘비명... “캐롤라이나 · 라지노프 - 성스러운 빛 아래에 잠들었고, 영혼은 눈처럼 거룩하다”...","source_cn":"这墓志铭，“卡列琳娜·拉季诺夫——她安眠于圣光之下，灵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB3EE65893B74382","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1311018003:1":{"text":"엇, 캐롤라이나, 이, 이건 당신의 묘지인가요?","source_cn":"咦，卡列琳娜，这、这是你的墓穴？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC316EB6D2DD555B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1311018004:1":{"text":"맞아요. 망자의 영혼을 놀라게 할 거라는 걱정은 하지 않으셔도 돼요. 전 전혀 개의치 않으니까요.","source_cn":"没错，所以你们毋需担心惊扰亡者的灵魂，我并不在意这些。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7F39EDFB3212DCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1311018005:1":{"text":"고마워, 캐롤라이나.","source_cn":"谢谢你，卡列琳娜。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8441BACE7DE4828","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1311018006:1":{"text":"수도원은 과거 저의 피난처이자, 제 마음의 고향이기도 했기에 이곳에서 무슨 일이 일어나는 걸 원치 않아요...","source_cn":"修道院曾是我的避风港，我的心灵家园。我不希望这里出事……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A8C846599FC441F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1311018007:1":{"text":"언니, 언니는 우리 할아버지와 어깨를 나란히 하고 싸운 영웅이니 이렇게 부탁할게요, 이 수도원을 보호하고, 고통받는 사람들을 지켜줘요.","source_cn":"瓦丽卡姐姐，你是和我的祖父并肩作战的英雄。我请求你，保...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2DAE8BB7FE7F059","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1311018008:1":{"text":"캐롤라이나, 난 영웅이 아니야... 하지만 최선을 다하겠다고 약속할게.","source_cn":"卡列琳娜，我不是什么英雄……但我保证，我会尽全力去做。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE5761018CE7CD99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1311018009:1":{"text":"여신의 가호가 있기를.","source_cn":"愿女神保佑你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1581BC0906FB5DC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卡列琳娜":{"text":"캐롤라이나","source":"卡列琳娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瓦丽卡":{"text":"발리카","source":"瓦丽卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"spe